5,1,1,talk,May,,"I checked the tally. The two nearest the door used it eleven times; the rest of us, four. Who’s actually using this?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,That’s the pattern I’ve noticed too. The noise and crumbs follow the same people.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,A room that serves only a few will quietly consume the time of the many.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want the actual numbers on paper before we agree to anything. Who is paying for this mess right now?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I just want a place where we can actually talk without everyone staring.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
